1
00:00:00,706 --> 00:00:03,546
(Sheldon(on phone):)Tell me another interest of yours.

2
00:00:03,709 --> 00:00:07,879
Oh, I'm sorry. I have no desire to get
in the water till I absolutely have to.

3
00:00:08,047 --> 00:00:10,257
(Sheldon(on phone):)Tell me another interest of yours.

4
00:00:10,424 --> 00:00:13,054
- Uh-oh, he's stuck in an infinite loop.
- I can fix it.

5
00:00:13,219 --> 00:00:14,719
Mm-hm. Mm-hm.

6
00:00:14,887 --> 00:00:19,437
(Sheldon:)It's interesting but isn't ventriloquism
by definition a solo activity?

7
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,940
Yeah. Tell me another interest of yours.

8
00:00:23,103 --> 00:00:24,393
(Sheldon:)Hmm.

9
00:00:24,563 --> 00:00:27,313
(Sheldon:)Is there any chance you like monkeys?

10
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:29,063
Yeah, what is wrong with you?

11
00:00:29,235 --> 00:00:31,615
(Sheldon:)Everybody likes monkeys.

12
00:00:32,071 --> 00:00:33,281
(Sheldon:)Hang on, Kripke.

13
00:00:35,741 --> 00:00:40,411
A loop counter and an escape
to the least objectionable activity.

14
00:00:40,579 --> 00:00:42,249
(Sheldon:)Howard, that's brilliant.

15
00:00:42,414 --> 00:00:44,754
(Sheldon:)I'm surprised you saw that.

16
00:00:45,918 --> 00:00:49,258
(Howard:)Gee, why can't Sheldon make friends?

17
00:00:49,797 --> 00:00:53,387
All right. That last interest strikes me
as the least objectionable.

18
00:00:53,551 --> 00:00:57,091
(Sheldon:)And I would like to propose
that we do that together.

